  unitName: Gaia King Lugina
  unitId: 30234
  unitNumber: 337
  description: A mock Unit modeled after Lugina, a Summoner belonging to the Akras
    Summoners' Hall. Though his skills are often looked down upon due to his poor
    conduct, when he releases his true power he becomes one of the strongest in the
    whole of the Akras Summoners' Hall. He apparently defeated an evil god with an
    attack so powerful it shook the whole of Grand Gaia, but since no one was around
    to witness it many say Lugina simply exaggerated the story.
  summonDesc: It seems you've finally realized<br>just how awesome I really am!<br>Now
    pay your respects!
  fusionDesc: Hey, you!<br>......Aha!<br>That's the stuff!
  evoDesc: This is my true power!<br>Peel open your eyes and <br>gaze upon my glory!
  element: 3
  rarity: 4
